{"label":"1B","direction":"against","claim":"At UMGC, Element AVITI is priced at about 2.1x Ultima per 30x genome, and AVITI Ultra Q at about 5x. Element is not a price threat at this core.","detail":"External 30x prices are $221 (Ultima), $469 (AVITI) and $1,168 (AVITI Ultra Q). The ratios are 469/221 = 2.1x and 1,168/221 = 5.3x. Internal prices are $192, $407 and $1,015, or 2.1x and 5.3x. Small batch sizes (4 and 2 samples) likely explain part of the premium. Element's low-price challenge is therefore weaker than Ultima's at this core. This partly cuts against the 1B claim about Element.","url":"https://genomics.umn.edu/service/human-whole-genome-sequencing","date":"2026 (undated)","source_name":"UMGC human WGS price table","source_type":"price_list","quote":"","strength":"weak","why_new":"The Ultra Q price and the internal/external ladder are new; F006 gives only the AVITI 2x ratio."},
